[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9006.469, "timestamp": "02:30:06", "text": "我還是會玩的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9019.59, "timestamp": "02:30:19", "text": "哦，好的。好的。嗨。下次地牢突襲什麼時候開始？我很期待。好的。別介意。如果我的聲音斷斷續續的，也別介意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9030.389, "timestamp": "02:30:30", "text": "。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9035.59, "timestamp": "02:30:35", "text": "剛才在椅子上懶散地坐著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9038.15, "timestamp": "02:30:38", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9040.87, "timestamp": "02:30:40", "text": "所以，嗯，嗯，嗯，嗯，我想問一件事。"}]